            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Legacy in Film</strong><br>\nHitchcock left an indelible mark on the film industry. His works have influenced countless filmmakers and have become studies in suspense, horror, and the art of cinematic storytelling.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Personal Life and Personality</strong><br>\nKnown for his sharp wit and dry humor, Hitchcock had a commanding presence in film culture. His public persona as a mischievous and sometimes sinister figure contributed to the aura surrounding his films.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Death and Posthumous Recognition</strong><br>\nHitchcock died in 1980, but his legacy lives on. He has been honored posthumously with the American Film Institute's Life Achievement Award, and his films continue to be celebrated for their craftmanship and enduring impact on global cinema.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
